  "job_B3.3.28_20251003_114714": {
    "chunk_text": "en heof & wop, & orefcwealm mycel for folces synnen. & w\u00e6stmes, \u00e6ig\u00f0er gea on wude gea on felde, ne synd swa gode, swa heo iu w\u00e6ron, ac yfele\u00f0 swy\u00f0e & se \u00feinc\u00f0 nu w\u00e6rrest & geapest, \u00fee o\u00f0erne m\u00e6ig beswican, & his \u00e6hte him of anymen. Eac man swere\u00f0 man mare \u00feone he scolde, \u00fey hit is \u00fee wyrse wide on eor\u00f0e, & beo \u00fean we mugen Ne spare\u00f0 nu se f\u00e6der \u00fean sune, ne nan mann o\u00f0ren, ac \u00e6lc man win\u00f0 ongean o\u00f0ren, & Godes lage ne Beo \u00fean we mugen ongyten, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feiss wurld is aweigweard & swy\u00f0e neh \u00fean \u00e6nde \u00feysser wurlde. Eale, ges\u00e6lig by\u00f0 se \u00fee hine sylfen on time gebyrege\u00f0. Uten nu bidden georne Seinte Neoten & o\u00f0re halgen, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ure \u00feingeres beon to \u00fean Heofonkinge,.",
